  "prompt": "풍선 터트리기 게임을 만들어줘. 아래에서 떠오르는 풍선을 탭하거나 클릭해서 터뜨리면 점수, 폭탄 풍선은 피하고 황금 풍선은 보너스, 연속 콤보, 놓치면 목숨 감소, 레벨업 속도 증가, 1000점 클리어. 밝고 귀여운 하늘 배경.",
  "description": "하늘에서 떠오르는 풍선을 탭/클릭 또는 조준 커서(방향키·조이스틱)+스페이스/POP 버튼으로 터뜨리는 캐주얼 게임입니다. 보통(10)·작은(20)·황금(50) 풍선, 3연속 이상 콤보 보너스, 폭탄을 터뜨리거나 풍선을 놓치면 목숨 -1(3개), 150점마다 레벨업으로 속도·개수 증가, 1,000점 클리어. 파티클·떠오르는 점수·구름 배경·WebAudio 효과음, 인트로(START/튜토리얼)·클리어·게임오버 패널, 플랫폼 헤더/풋터 safe-area, 세로·가로 반응형, 오토파일럿(가장 시급한 풍선 조준)과 매니페스트(rules/tips/stateDoc, buttons.jump=POP) 포함.",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover\">\n<title>풍선 터트리기</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}\nhtml,body{height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#0b1230;font-family:-apple-system,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Noto Sans KR\",system-ui,sans-serif;color:#fff;touch-action:none;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none}\ncanvas#game{position:fixed;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block}\nbutton{font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer;touch-action:manipulation}\n/* HUD — 플랫폼 헤더 아래 */\n#hud{position:fixed;left:12px;right:12px;top:calc(var(--vbx-top,56px) + 8px);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;pointer-events:none;z-index:5}\n.pill{background:rgba(0,0,0,.42);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 12px;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.02em;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}\n.pill small{font-weight:600;opacity:.75;font-size:11px}\n#lives{letter-spacing:2px}\n#combo{position:fixed;left:50%;top:calc(var(--vbx-top,56px) + 52px);transform:translateX(-50%);font-weight:900;font-size:22px;color:#ffe066;text-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.5);opacity:0;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s;pointer-events:none;z-index:5}\n#combo.show{opacity:1;transform:translateX(-50%) scale(1.15)}\n#goalbar{position:fixed;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);bottom:calc(var(--vbx-inset,0px) + 14px);width:min(320px,60vw);height:6px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);overflow:hidden;z-index:5;pointer-events:none}\n#goalbar i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ff6b9d,#ffe066);border-radius:999px;transition:width .3s}\n/* 패널 */\n.ov{position:fixed;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:calc(var(--vbx-top,56px) + 8px) 16px calc(var(--vbx-inset,0px) + 16px);z-index:10;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%,rgba(60,90,200,.35),rgba(5,8,25,.85))}\n.ov.hidden{display:none}\n.pan{width:min(420px,100%);max-height:100%;overflow:auto;text-align:center;background:rgba(10,16,45,.82);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);border-radius:22px;padding:24px 20px;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}\nh1{font-size:clamp(28px,7vw,40px);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.02em;text-shadow:0 4px 0 #b23a63,0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}\n.sub{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:14px;opacity:.85;line-height:1.5}\n.btn{width:100%;height:52px;border:none;border-radius:16px;font-size:18px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.06em;margin-top:10px;color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ff7aa9,#ff3d7f);box-shadow:0 6px 0 #a82355,0 12px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n.btn:active{transform:translateY(3px);box-shadow:0 3px 0 #a82355}\n.btn.ghost{background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);box-shadow:none;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);font-size:15px;height:46px}\n.btn.ghost:active{transform:none}\n.tut{text-align:left;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;margin-top:6px}\n.tut b{color:#ffe066}\n.tut .row{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin:4px 0}\nkbd{display:inline-block;min-width:26px;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:6px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-align:center}\n.big{font-size:clamp(34px,9vw,56px);font-weight:900;color:#ffe066;line-height:1.1;margin:6px 0}\n@media (max-height:480px){.pan{padding:12px 16px}h1{font-size:24px;text-shadow:0 2px 0 #b23a63}.sub{margin:4px 0 8px;font-size:12px}.btn{height:40px;font-size:15px;margin-top:6px}.big{font-size:30px}.tut{font-size:12px;line-height:1.5}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<canvas id=\"game\"></canvas>\n<div id=\"hud\">\n  <div class=\"pill\"><small>SCORE</small><span id=\"score\">0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"pill\"><small>LV</small><span id=\"level\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"pill\" id=\"lives\">❤❤❤</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"combo\"></div>\n<div id=\"goalbar\"><i id=\"goalfill\"></i></div>\n\n<div id=\"intro\" class=\"ov\">\n  <div class=\"pan\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:54px;line-height:1\">🎈</div>\n    <h1>풍선 터트리기</h1>\n    <p class=\"sub\">둥실둥실 떠오르는 풍선을 터뜨려 점수를 모으세요!<br>💣 폭탄은 피하고, ⭐ 황금 풍선은 보너스</p>\n    <button id=\"vibrex-start\" data-vibrex-role=\"start\" class=\"btn\">▶ START</button>\n    <button id=\"vibrex-tutorial\" data-vibrex-role=\"tutorial\" class=\"btn ghost\">튜토리얼</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"tutorial\" class=\"ov hidden\">\n  <div class=\"pan\">\n    <h1 style=\"font-size:24px;text-shadow:none\">튜토리얼</h1>\n    <div class=\"tut\">\n      <div class=\"row\">👆 <span><b>탭/클릭</b> — 풍선을 터뜨린다 (모바일은 화면을 바로 탭)</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><kbd>←</kbd><kbd>→</kbd><kbd>↑</kbd><kbd>↓</kbd> <span>조준 커서 이동 (모바일: 조이스틱)</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><kbd>SPACE</kbd> <span>커서 위치 터뜨리기 (모바일: POP 버튼)</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\">🎈 <span>보통 풍선 <b>+10</b> · 작은 풍선은 빨라서 <b>+20</b></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\">⭐ <span>황금 풍선 <b>+50</b> · 연속으로 터뜨리면 <b>콤보 보너스</b></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\">💣 <span>폭탄을 터뜨리면 <b>목숨 -1</b> · 풍선을 놓쳐 위로 날아가도 <b>-1</b></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\">🏁 <span>목표 <b>1,000점</b>을 채우면 클리어! 레벨이 오를수록 빨라진다</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <button data-vibrex-role=\"tutorial-close\" id=\"tut-close\" class=\"btn ghost\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">닫기</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"over\" class=\"ov hidden\">\n  <div class=\"pan\">\n    <div id=\"over-emo\" style=\"font-size:48px;line-height:1\">💥</div>\n    <h1 id=\"over-title\">GAME OVER</h1>\n    <div class=\"big\" id=\"over-score\">0</div>\n    <p class=\"sub\" id=\"over-sub\">풍선 0개 · 최대 콤보 0</p>\n    <button data-vibrex-role=\"restart\" id=\"restart\" class=\"btn\">다시하기</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n'use strict';\n// ── 설정 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────\nconst GOAL=1000, MAX_LIVES=3;\nconst cv=document.getElementById('game'), ctx=cv.getContext('2d');\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id);\nlet W=0,H=0,DPR=1, safeTop=56, inset=0;\nfunction cssPx(n,d){ const v=parseFloat(getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue(n)); return isFinite(v)?v:d; }\nfunction resize(){ DPR=Math.min(2,window.devicePixelRatio||1); W=innerWidth; H=innerHeight; cv.width=W*DPR; cv.height=H*DPR; ctx.setTransform(DPR,0,0,DPR,0,0); safeTop=cssPx('--vbx-top',56); inset=cssPx('--vbx-inset',0); cursor.x=Math.min(cursor.x,W-20); cursor.y=Math.min(cursor.y,H-20); }\n// ── 상태 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────\nlet phase='title', score=0, lives=MAX_LIVES, level=1, popped=0, combo=0, comboMax=0, comboT=0, missed=0, spawnT=0, tPlay=0, cleared=false;\nlet balloons=[], parts=[], pops=[], clouds=[];\nconst cursor={x:0,y:0,vx:0,vy:0,shown:false};\nconst held={left:0,right:0,up:0,down:0};\n// ── 사운드 ───────────────────────────────────────────────\nconst snd={ctx:null,init(){ if(this.ctx)return; try{this.ctx=new (window.AudioContext||window.webkitAudioContext)();}catch(e){} },\n  t(f,d,type,v,dl){ if(!this.ctx)return; try{ const t=this.ctx.currentTime+(dl||0),o=this.ctx.createOscillator(),g=this.ctx.createGain(); o.type=type||'sine'; o.frequency.setValueAtTime(f,t); g.gain.setValueAtTime(v||.2,t); g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.001,t+d); o.connect(g); g.connect(this.ctx.destination); o.start(t); o.stop(t+d+.02);}catch(e){} },\n  pop(k){ if(!this.ctx)return; try{ const t=this.ctx.currentTime,n=Math.floor(this.ctx.sampleRate*.08),b=this.ctx.createBuffer(1,n,this.ctx.sampleRate),d=b.getChannelData(0); for(let i=0;i<n;i++)d[i]=(Math.random()*2-1)*(1-i/n); const s=this.ctx.createBufferSource(),f=this.ctx.createBiquadFilter(),g=this.ctx.createGain(); s.buffer=b; f.type='bandpass'; f.frequency.value=k==='gold'?2400:k==='small'?1800:1200; g.gain.value=.5; s.connect(f); f.connect(g); g.connect(this.ctx.destination); s.start(t); }catch(e){} if(k==='gold'){[880,1108,1318,1760].forEach((f,i)=>this.t(f,.18,'triangle',.18,i*.06));} },\n  bomb(){ this.t(120,.5,'sawtooth',.35); this.t(60,.6,'square',.3,.05); }, miss(){ this.t(330,.25,'square',.15); this.t(220,.3,'square',.15,.12); }, lvl(){[523,659,784,1047].forEach((f,i)=>this.t(f,.15,'square',.18,i*.08));}, clear(){[523,659,784,1047,1318].forEach((f,i)=>this.t(f,.35,'triangle',.22,i*.12));} };\n// ── 풍선 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────\nconst COLORS=['#ff4f6d','#ff9a3c','#ffd23f','#6ddc4a','#3fa9ff','#9d6bff','#ff6fc8','#3ed3c1'];\nfunction spawn(){ const r=Math.random(); let kind='normal', rad=26+Math.random()*10;\n  if(r<0.10+level*0.01) kind='bomb'; else if(r<0.17) kind='gold'; else if(r<0.42) { kind='small'; rad=17+Math.random()*4; }\n  const speed=(kind==='small'?95:kind==='gold'?80:60)+level*9+Math.random()*25;\n  balloons.push({x:rad+Math.random()*(W-rad*2),y:H+rad+10,r:rad,kind,color:kind==='gold'?'#ffd60a':kind==='bomb'?'#2b2d42':COLORS[Math.floor(Math.random()*COLORS.length)],vy:speed,sway:Math.random()*6.28,sw:.6+Math.random()*1.2,amp:14+Math.random()*24}); }\nfunction spawnInterval(){ return Math.max(0.28,0.95-level*0.07); }\nfunction popAt(px,py,fromKey){ if(phase!=='playing')return false; let best=null,bd=1e9; for(const b of balloons){ if(b.dead)continue; const d=Math.hypot(b.x-px,b.y-py); const hit=d<b.r+(fromKey?14:12); if(hit&&d<bd){bd=d;best=b;} } if(!best){ if(!fromKey){ combo=0; } return false; } popBalloon(best); return true; }\nfunction popBalloon(b){ b.dead=true; burst(b.x,b.y,b.color,b.kind==='bomb'?26:16,b.kind==='bomb');\n  if(b.kind==='bomb'){ snd.bomb(); combo=0; loseLife('💣'); shake=10; return; }\n  const base=b.kind==='gold'?50:b.kind==='small'?20:10; combo++; comboT=1.6; comboMax=Math.max(comboMax,combo); const bonus=combo>=3?Math.floor(base*(combo>=6?1:0.5)):0; score+=base+bonus; popped++; snd.pop(b.kind);\n  pops.push({x:b.x,y:b.y,t:0,txt:'+'+(base+bonus)+(combo>=3?' x'+combo:''),gold:b.kind==='gold'});\n  if(window.AJ)try{AJ.score(score)}catch(e){}\n  const lv=1+Math.floor(score/150); if(lv>level){ level=lv; snd.lvl(); pops.push({x:W/2,y:H*0.4,t:0,txt:'LEVEL '+level,gold:true,big:true}); if(window.AJ)try{AJ.level(level)}catch(e){} }\n  if(score>=GOAL){ finish(true); } }\nfunction loseLife(why){ lives--; missed++; pops.push({x:W/2,y:H*0.35,t:0,txt:why+' -1',gold:false,big:true}); hud(); if(lives<=0) finish(false); }\nlet shake=0;\nfunction burst(x,y,color,n,dark){ for(let i=0;i<n;i++){ const a=Math.random()*6.28,v=80+Math.random()*220; parts.push({x,y,vx:Math.cos(a)*v,vy:Math.sin(a)*v-60,life:.5+Math.random()*.5,color:dark?(Math.random()<.5?'#ff7b00':'#555'):color,r:2+Math.random()*4}); } }\n// ── 진행 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────\nfunction start(){ snd.init(); if(snd.ctx&&snd.ctx.state==='suspended')snd.ctx.resume(); score=0; lives=MAX_LIVES; level=1; popped=0; combo=0; comboMax=0; missed=0; spawnT=0; tPlay=0; cleared=false; balloons=[]; parts=[]; pops=[]; cursor.x=W/2; cursor.y=H*0.55; cursor.shown=false; phase='playing'; $('intro').classList.add('hidden'); $('over').classList.add('hidden'); $('tutorial').classList.add('hidden'); hud(); if(window.AJ)try{AJ.start()}catch(e){} }\nfunction finish(win){ if(phase!=='playing')return; phase=win?'cleared':'over'; cleared=win; const o=$('over'); $('over-emo').textContent=win?'🎉':'💥'; $('over-title').textContent=win?'CLEAR!':'GAME OVER'; $('over-score').textContent=score.toLocaleString(); $('over-sub').textContent=`풍선 ${popped}개 · 최대 콤보 ${comboMax} · 레벨 ${level}`; o.classList.remove('hidden'); o.querySelector('.pan').setAttribute('data-vibrex-role',win?'clear':'over'); if(win)snd.clear(); else snd.miss(); if(window.AJ)try{ win?(AJ.clear?AJ.clear(score):AJ.over(score)):AJ.over(score) }catch(e){} }\nfunction hud(){ $('score').textContent=score.toLocaleString(); $('level').textContent=level; $('lives').textContent='❤'.repeat(Math.max(0,lives))+'♡'.repeat(Math.max(0,MAX_LIVES-lives)); $('goalfill').style.width=Math.min(100,score/GOAL*100)+'%'; }\n// ── 루프 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────\nlet last=0;\nfunction loop(ts){ const dt=Math.min(0.05,(ts-last)/1000||0); last=ts; if(phase==='playing')update(dt); draw(dt); requestAnimationFrame(loop); }\nfunction update(dt){ tPlay+=dt; spawnT-=dt; if(spawnT<=0){ spawn(); if(level>=3&&Math.random()<.35)spawn(); spawnT=spawnInterval(); }\n  for(const b of balloons){ if(b.dead)continue; b.sway+=b.sw*dt; b.y-=b.vy*dt; b.x+=Math.sin(b.sway)*b.amp*dt; b.x=Math.max(b.r,Math.min(W-b.r,b.x)); if(b.y<-b.r-6){ b.dead=true; if(b.kind!=='bomb'){ snd.miss(); combo=0; loseLife('🎈 놓침'); } } }\n  balloons=balloons.filter(b=>!b.dead);\n  for(const p of parts){ p.x+=p.vx*dt; p.y+=p.vy*dt; p.vy+=380*dt; p.life-=dt; } parts=parts.filter(p=>p.life>0);\n  for(const p of pops)p.t+=dt; pops=pops.filter(p=>p.t<1);\n  if(comboT>0){ comboT-=dt; if(comboT<=0)combo=0; }\n  // 커서(키보드·조이스틱)\n  const sp=420; cursor.vx=(held.right-held.left)*sp; cursor.vy=(held.down-held.up)*sp; if(cursor.vx||cursor.vy){ cursor.shown=true; cursor.x=Math.max(10,Math.min(W-10,cursor.x+cursor.vx*dt)); cursor.y=Math.max(safeTop+10,Math.min(H-inset-10,cursor.y+cursor.vy*dt)); }\n  if(bot.on)botTick(dt);\n  if(shake>0)shake-=dt*40; hud(); const c=$('combo'); if(combo>=3){ c.textContent='COMBO x'+combo; c.classList.add('show'); } else c.classList.remove('show'); }\nfunction draw(dt){ ctx.save(); if(shake>0)ctx.translate((Math.random()-.5)*shake,(Math.random()-.5)*shake);\n  if(!drawBackground()){ const g=ctx.createLinearGradient(0,0,0,H); g.addColorStop(0,'#1a2a6c'); g.addColorStop(.6,'#3a6fd8'); g.addColorStop(1,'#8fd3ff'); ctx.fillStyle=g; ctx.fillRect(-20,-20,W+40,H+40);\n    if(!clouds.length) for(let i=0;i<6;i++)clouds.push({x:Math.random()*W,y:safeTop+40+Math.random()*(H*0.5),s:.6+Math.random()*.9,v:8+Math.random()*12});\n    ctx.fillStyle='rgba(255,255,255,.22)'; for(const c of clouds){ c.x+=c.v*dt; if(c.x>W+120)c.x=-120; const s=c.s; ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(c.x,c.y,26*s,0,6.28); ctx.arc(c.x+28*s,c.y-8*s,32*s,0,6.28); ctx.arc(c.x+58*s,c.y,24*s,0,6.28); ctx.fill(); } }\n  for(const b of balloons){ drawBalloon(b); }\n  for(const p of parts){ ctx.globalAlpha=Math.max(0,p.life); ctx.fillStyle=p.color; ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(p.x,p.y,p.r,0,6.28); ctx.fill(); } ctx.globalAlpha=1;\n  for(const p of pops){ ctx.globalAlpha=1-p.t; ctx.font=(p.big?'900 26px':'800 18px')+' sans-serif'; ctx.textAlign='center'; ctx.fillStyle=p.gold?'#ffe066':'#fff'; ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(0,0,0,.5)'; ctx.lineWidth=3; ctx.strokeText(p.txt,p.x,p.y-p.t*50); ctx.fillText(p.txt,p.x,p.y-p.t*50); } ctx.globalAlpha=1;\n  if(phase==='playing'&&cursor.shown){ ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(255,255,255,.9)'; ctx.lineWidth=2; ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(cursor.x,cursor.y,14,0,6.28); ctx.stroke(); ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(cursor.x-20,cursor.y); ctx.lineTo(cursor.x-8,cursor.y); ctx.moveTo(cursor.x+8,cursor.y); ctx.lineTo(cursor.x+20,cursor.y); ctx.moveTo(cursor.x,cursor.y-20); ctx.lineTo(cursor.x,cursor.y-8); ctx.moveTo(cursor.x,cursor.y+8); ctx.lineTo(cursor.x,cursor.y+20); ctx.stroke(); }\n  ctx.restore(); }\n// 배경 이미지 — 가로 화면은 'ballon_game_background'(1672×941), 세로 화면은 'ballon_background_mobile'(941×1672). 화면을 가득 채우게(cover) 중앙 정렬\nfunction drawBackground(){ if(!window.getAsset)return false; const name=W>H?'ballon_game_background':'ballon_background_mobile'; const img=window.getAsset(name)||window.getAsset(W>H?'ballon_background_mobile':'ballon_game_background'); if(!img||!img.complete||!img.naturalWidth)return false; const sc=Math.max(W/img.naturalWidth,H/img.naturalHeight),dw=img.naturalWidth*sc,dh=img.naturalHeight*sc; ctx.drawImage(img,(W-dw)/2,(H-dh)/2,dw,dh); return true; }\nfunction drawBalloon(b){ const {x,y,r}=b; ctx.save();\n  // 줄\n  ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(255,255,255,.7)'; ctx.lineWidth=Math.max(1.2,r*.06); ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(x,y+r*1.18); ctx.bezierCurveTo(x+Math.sin(b.sway)*r*.5,y+r*1.6,x-Math.sin(b.sway*1.3)*r*.4,y+r*1.95,x+Math.sin(b.sway)*r*.2,y+r*2.35); ctx.stroke();\n  const bomb=b.kind==='bomb', base=bomb?'#3b3f55':b.color;\n  // 그림자(살짝 아래)\n  ctx.fillStyle='rgba(0,0,0,.12)'; ctx.beginPath(); ctx.ellipse(x+r*.08,y+r*.12,r*.95,r*1.08,0,0,6.28); ctx.fill();\n  // 몸통 — 위는 둥글고 아래로 살짝 좁아지는 물방울형\n  ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(x,y-r*1.06); ctx.bezierCurveTo(x+r*1.25,y-r*1.06,x+r*1.12,y+r*.62,x,y+r*1.1); ctx.bezierCurveTo(x-r*1.12,y+r*.62,x-r*1.25,y-r*1.06,x,y-r*1.06); ctx.closePath();\n  const gr=ctx.createRadialGradient(x-r*.32,y-r*.42,r*.08,x,y,r*1.15); gr.addColorStop(0,bomb?'#8a90aa':shade(base,60)); gr.addColorStop(.45,base); gr.addColorStop(1,shade(base,-45)); ctx.fillStyle=gr; ctx.fill();\n  // 테두리(만화 느낌)\n  ctx.lineWidth=Math.max(1.5,r*.07); ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(255,255,255,.35)'; ctx.stroke();\n  // 큰 하이라이트 + 작은 반사점\n  ctx.fillStyle='rgba(255,255,255,.55)'; ctx.beginPath(); ctx.ellipse(x-r*.38,y-r*.5,r*.26,r*.38,-.5,0,6.28); ctx.fill();\n  ctx.fillStyle='rgba(255,255,255,.8)'; ctx.beginPath(); ctx.ellipse(x-r*.15,y-r*.78,r*.09,r*.06,-.4,0,6.28); ctx.fill();\n  // 매듭\n  ctx.fillStyle=shade(base,-30); ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(x-r*.16,y+r*1.28); ctx.lineTo(x+r*.16,y+r*1.28); ctx.lineTo(x,y+r*1.06); ctx.closePath(); ctx.fill();\n  ctx.font=(r*0.9|0)+'px serif'; ctx.textAlign='center'; ctx.textBaseline='middle'; if(bomb)ctx.fillText('💣',x,y+1); else if(b.kind==='gold')ctx.fillText('⭐',x,y+1);\n  ctx.restore(); }\nfunction shade(hex,p){ const n=parseInt(hex.slice(1),16); let r=(n>>16)&255,g=(n>>8)&255,b=n&255; r=Math.max(0,Math.min(255,r+p)); g=Math.max(0,Math.min(255,g+p)); b=Math.max(0,Math.min(255,b+p)); return `rgb(${r},${g},${b})`; }\n// ── 입력 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────\nfunction pointerPop(e){ if(phase!=='playing')return; snd.init(); const pt=e.touches?e.touches[0]:e; cursor.x=pt.clientX; cursor.y=pt.clientY; cursor.shown=false; popAt(pt.clientX,pt.clientY,false); }\ncv.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{ e.preventDefault(); pointerPop(e); });\nfunction press(name,on){ if(name in held){ held[name]=on?1:0; return; } if((name==='jump'||name==='fire')&&on&&phase==='playing'){ cursor.shown=true; popAt(cursor.x,cursor.y,true); } }\nconst KEYS={ArrowLeft:'left',ArrowRight:'right',ArrowUp:'up',ArrowDown:'down',Space:'jump',KeyA:'fire'};\ndocument.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{ const n=KEYS[e.code]; if(!n)return; e.preventDefault(); if(e.repeat)return; press(n,true); });\ndocument.addEventListener('keyup',e=>{ const n=KEYS[e.code]; if(!n)return; e.preventDefault(); press(n,false); });\naddEventListener('blur',()=>{held.left=held.right=held.up=held.down=0;});\n// ── 오토파일럿 ───────────────────────────────────────────\nconst bot={on:false,cool:0};\nfunction botTick(dt){ bot.cool-=dt; if(bot.cool>0)return; const P=(window.VIBREX_POLICY&&window.VIBREX_POLICY.params)||{}; const skill=P.botSkill!=null?+P.botSkill:0.8; const react=P.reactionMs!=null?+P.reactionMs/1000:0.12+(1-skill)*0.5;\n  let best=null,bs=-1; for(const b of balloons){ if(b.dead||b.kind==='bomb')continue; const s=(b.kind==='gold'?3:1)+ (H-b.y)/H*2; if(s>bs){bs=s;best=b;} } if(!best){ bot.cool=0.1; return; }\n  cursor.x=best.x+(Math.random()-.5)*(1-skill)*40; cursor.y=best.y+(Math.random()-.5)*(1-skill)*40; cursor.shown=true; popAt(cursor.x,cursor.y,true); bot.cool=react; }\nwindow.vibrexBot={ start(){ bot.on=true; if(phase!=='playing'){ $('vibrex-start').click(); } }, stop(){ bot.on=false; } };\n// ── UI ──────────────────────────────────────────────────\n$('vibrex-start').onclick=start; $('restart').onclick=start;\n$('vibrex-tutorial').onclick=()=>{ snd.init(); $('tutorial').classList.remove('hidden'); }; $('tut-close').onclick=()=>$('tutorial').classList.add('hidden');\naddEventListener('resize',resize); addEventListener('vibrex:host',resize); resize(); cursor.x=W/2; cursor.y=H*0.55; hud(); requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n// ── 플랫폼 계약 ───────────────────────────────────────────\nwindow.VIBREX_GAME={ title:'풍선 터트리기', genre:'casual', stick:'hold', buttons:{jump:'POP'},\n  goal:'풍선을 터뜨려 1,000점 달성', clearCondition:'점수 1,000점 (목숨 3개가 다 떨어지면 게임오버)',\n  controls:[{input:'ArrowLeft',action:'커서 왼쪽'},{input:'ArrowRight',action:'커서 오른쪽'},{input:'ArrowUp',action:'커서 위'},{input:'ArrowDown',action:'커서 아래'},{input:'Space',action:'커서 위치 터뜨리기'}],\n  rules:['풍선을 탭/클릭하거나 커서를 맞추고 스페이스로 터뜨리면 점수(보통 10, 작은 풍선 20, 황금 50)','3연속 이상 터뜨리면 콤보 보너스(3~5연속 +50%, 6연속부터 2배)','폭탄(💣)을 터뜨리거나 풍선이 화면 위로 놓치면 목숨 -1, 목숨 3개','150점마다 레벨업하며 풍선이 빨라지고 많아진다','1,000점에 도달하면 클리어'],\n  tips:['화면 위쪽에 가까운 풍선부터 터뜨려 놓치지 않기','황금 풍선은 우선순위 최상','폭탄은 절대 건드리지 말고 지나가게 두기(폭탄은 놓쳐도 감점 없음)','빠른 작은 풍선은 미리 조준'],\n  stateDoc:{score:'점수',lives:'남은 목숨',level:'레벨',progress:'목표 대비 진행률 0~1',combo:'현재 콤보',targetDX:'가장 시급한(위쪽) 풍선의 커서 기준 좌우 -1~1',targetDY:'그 풍선의 커서 기준 상하 -1~1',targetDist:'그 풍선까지 거리(px)',targetKind:'그 풍선 종류 normal/small/gold',dangerDX:'가장 가까운 폭탄의 커서 기준 좌우',dangerDist:'가장 가까운 폭탄까지 거리(px)',balloons:'화면 풍선 수',fireReady:'터뜨릴 수 있음 1'},\n  phase(){ return phase; }, progress(){ return Math.min(1,score/GOAL); },\n  state(){ let best=null,bd=1e9,bomb=null,bb=1e9; for(const b of balloons){ if(b.dead)continue; if(b.kind==='bomb'){ const d=Math.hypot(b.x-cursor.x,b.y-cursor.y); if(d<bb){bb=d;bomb=b;} } else if(!best||b.y<best.y)best=b; } const st={score,lives,level,progress:Math.min(1,score/GOAL),combo,balloons:balloons.length,fireReady:1}; if(best){ st.targetDX=Math.max(-1,Math.min(1,(best.x-cursor.x)/W*2)); st.targetDY=Math.max(-1,Math.min(1,(best.y-cursor.y)/H*2)); st.targetDist=Math.round(Math.hypot(best.x-cursor.x,best.y-cursor.y)); st.targetKind=best.kind; } if(bomb){ st.dangerDX=Math.max(-1,Math.min(1,(bomb.x-cursor.x)/W*2)); st.dangerDist=Math.round(bb); } return st; },\n  start(){ if(phase!=='playing')start(); }, restart(){ start(); },\n  inputs:{ left:on=>press('left',on), right:on=>press('right',on), up:on=>press('up',on), down:on=>press('down',on), jump:on=>press('jump',on) } };\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
}